that, re-raises other errors, and gives up after the 3rd attempt.\nSmoke test against a real local HTTP server:\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries when the server returns 503. It makes 3 attempts in total, waiting 0.5s and then 1s between them (doubling each time). The settings are module constants: `MAX_ATTEMPTS = 3` and `BACKOFF_BASE = 0.5`.\n\n- **503:** the client retries. If the third attempt also gets a 503, it raises the normal `HTTPError` to the caller.\n- **Any other HTTP error (e.g. 500):** raised straight away, no retry.\n- **Network errors (`URLError`, timeouts):** not retried, since you only asked about 503.\n\nI checked it against a local HTTP server with the backoff shortened:\n\n| Server responses | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| 503, 503, 200 | returned the data | 3 |\n| 503, 503, 503, \u2026 | `HTTPError 503` | 3 |\n| 500 | `HTTPError 500` | 1 |\n| 200 | returned the data | 1 |\n\nThe repo has no test suite, so I didn't add one.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 35053, "requests_cache_write": 142409, "requests_cost_usd": 0.7512436, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1607, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial7", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 73, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:47:44.758041+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 22.877, "t_checker_s": 2.433, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens"